## ---- SECRETS: never commit ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets.json
*secrets*.json
SECRETS.txt
# credential DATA files only — extension-anchored so source files whose NAMES
# contain "credential"/"password" (XtsCredentials.cs, ResetPasswordPrompt.xaml)
# are NOT swallowed. Windows git has core.ignorecase=true, so bare *PASSWORD*
# matches PasswordResetService.cs and silently drops it from the repo.
*credentials*.txt
*credentials*.json
*passwords*.txt
DHAN_CREDENTIALS.txt
ENTER_CREDENTIALS.txt
token.txt
*_creds.txt
*_creds.json
*.secrets.json
config.json
!config.example.json
!config-templates/
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.local.json
broker-secrets.json
*.pem
*.ppk
*.pfx
*.key
!*.public.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.bak-*
*.lexical-backup.json
.rename-backup/

