## ---- Added 2026-08-24: keys and bulk that must stay local ----
# Inno Setup scripts bake the live agent enrollment key into the installer.
# Track the .template files (placeholder key) and keep the real ones local.
deploy/*.iss
deploy/newvps/*.iss
!*.iss.template

# Build output and compiled installers (deploy/Output held a 47 MB exe named .jpeg).
deploy/out/
deploy/Output/
deploy/newvps/Output/
